id: armor
name: Armor
kind: crafting
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Damage Reduction equal to the Apparel Bonus. Always the Top Layer, with nothing put on over it.
text: >
  Armor. Gain Damage Reduction equal to the Apparel Bonus. Armor must be the Top Layer of your
  Apparel and you cannot equip any piece of Apparel while wearing Armor.

